1-MINUTE INTERVIEW REVISION
=========================================================

Association  → Uses / Knows

Aggregation  → Weak HAS-A

Composition  → Strong HAS-A

Dependency   → Temporary Uses

Inheritance  → IS-A

Realization  → Implements

Remember:

Association → No ownership

Aggregation → Weak ownership

Composition → Strong ownership

Inheritance → Reuse behavior

Realization → Implement interface

Golden Rule:

Prefer Composition over Inheritance whenever possible.
